John and Mike,

The City has reviewed your request to extend night work hours for the Phase 2 deck pour operations. Based on the noise study submitted on April 8th, we can approve the following:

- Extended hours: 10:00 PM to 5:00 AM (previously approved 11 PM - 4 AM)
- Duration: April 22 through May 10, 2024
- Conditions: Noise monitoring at receptor locations R-1 through R-4 must remain below 75 dBA

Please note:
1. The contractor must provide 48-hour advance notice to adjacent property owners
2. A noise monitor must be on-site during all night operations
3. Any exceedance requires immediate work stoppage and notification to the City

The permit amendment will be issued by end of day Wednesday. Let me know if you have questions.

